        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6551 Mortise Reading Entry Set with 5015 Half-Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBuilt with the quality you'd expect from Baldwin, the 6551 Reading Estate Collection Entrance Set has a lifetime limited warranty on the workmanship, mechanical operation, and the PVD Polished Brass finish. The classic rectangular design when paired with the 5015 half-round knob make this entry set perfect for traditional homes; and since it will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\", you'll be sure to find just the right one for your doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/classic-2-inch-knobset-baldwin-5000\"><b>Baldwin 5000 Half-Round Knobset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6551 Reading Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and PVD Polished Brass finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estate Collection Reading Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5015 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .187\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6551.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Reading Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-2-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"250\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\"></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Reading Entrance Set, Baldwin 6551",
                "description": "Baldwin 6551 Reading Entrance Set - Built with the quality you'd expect from Baldwin, the 6551 Reading Estate Collection Entrance Set has a lifetime limited warranty on the workmanship, mechanical operation, and the PVD Polished Brass finish. The classic rectangular design when paired with the 5015 half-round knob make this entry set perfect for traditional homes; and since it will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches, you'll be sure to find just the right one for your doors.",
                "keywords": "baldwin 6551, BAL-6551, bladwin Reading entrance sets, baldwin Reading entrysets, square entry sets, traditional entry sets, solid brass entrysets, mortise entrysets, mortise entrance sets, mortise handlesets, single cylinder entrance sets, traditional front door hardware, baldwin estate collection entry sets, baldwin estates collection entrance sets,"
